      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    initial_index = 100.0\n    notional_amount = 100_000_000.0\n    fixed_rate = 0.03\n    payment_frequency = 4\n\n    # Three months have elapsed, leaving three quarterly payments\n    present_value_factors = [0.997506, 0.992556, 0.985222]\n\n    fixed_payment = (fixed_rate * notional_amount) / payment_frequency\n    present_value_fixed_leg = sum(\n        fixed_payment * factor for factor in present_value_factors\n    )\n\n    # At zero value, the equity return equals the present value of the fixed leg\n    equity_return = present_value_fixed_leg / notional_amount\n    index_level = initial_index * (1 + equity_return)\n\n    # return answer\n    return round(index_level, 3)\n```",
